1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:07,764
This video shows an illustration in a long page that plays only while it can be seen. It needs no scroll code.

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,782
Let's put the ball in the middle of the story.

3
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:26,021
It is below the fold. Its file says start on load and pause off screen, so it waits until you scroll to it.

4
00:00:27,267 --> 00:00:30,010
Let's scroll down to it, and then past it.

5
00:00:40,033 --> 00:00:46,616
It plays while half of it is on screen, pauses when it scrolls away, and picks up again when it comes back.

6
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:54,521
So, autoplay and the settings in the file handle the scrolling. There is no scroll code at all.
